{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-14T00:28:11Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 机器学习 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_977d02a4da406cd8e25ea62cd18a8c0116d1703e436ad59d1f331dd726a06b88","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-blogs_podcasts-production-mlops-at-gs-caltex-with-amazon-sagemake-0-4536e10993/","observation_id":"obs_4536e10993f7030af8c202010afc26234a100576c2a235c65b97303580c3bc39","published_at":"2026-11-13T23:22:09Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"GS Caltex 介绍了如何将 Amazon SageMaker Canvas 中构建并验证的模型与预处理流程，接入 Amazon SageMaker Pipelines 的生产工作流。其目标是缩短部署周期，并支持定时批量推理。","title":"Production MLOps at GS Caltex with Amazon SageMaker Canvas, part 1"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_51b342f359c37e1a71af385f6b9469d4f0c1dcba8a74024c6d65e671996500be","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-blogs_podcasts-new-ai-copilot-helps-engineers-design-better-struc-0-babb1d6956/","observation_id":"obs_babb1d695637283d5ca3646f8300aeecbe29c83848d74c59fb63eb8c9b884bb8","published_at":"2026-11-13T05:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"MIT 团队提出了一种“人在回路中”的拓扑优化系统：算法生成结构时，由机器学习快速标出设计师可能需要调整的区域，让人边设计边反馈。它希望兼顾计算效率、结构性能、制造可行性与工程师对结果的掌控感。","title":"New AI “copilot” helps engineers design better structures"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_8fc1dac9dcdcbcb2f58e259523a7875f879e074e091d701c05f10125bcdf9001","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-arxiv-agentssl-can-mle-agents-leverage-unlabeled-data-0-0eeb85033b/","observation_id":"obs_0eeb85033b17e767df2baf29952590b87a1d0a37fafcf55314bf3032800cc91f","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:59:06Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"AgentSSL 研究 MLE 智能体在标注数据有限、未标注数据丰富时，能否自动组合并改进半监督学习方案。实验显示其在多数设置中超过人工基线，但程序选择仍会造成明显性能下降，并配套提出 ProgramSelectBench 基准。","title":"AgentSSL: Can MLE Agents Leverage Unlabeled Data?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_41d3f459fdf663c57644e0e2751ead5861c390fbdd58b9793d32be7cc3125a0a","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-aiml--0-e3fb265c4a/","observation_id":"obs_e3fb265c4a7f0c03e332381c674e35ece02aac3c1eec6df11ee65ed9b8e8bec6","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:05:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份面向 AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML 专题的参会指南，介绍不同会话形式，并按 AI 芯片、模型训练与推理、智能体开发及管理等层级整理相关学习内容。内容还梳理了 AWS 从基础设施到智能体解决方案的 AI 技术栈。","title":"The attendee’s guide to the AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML track"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ef45433b032bc579e197be1c644e0ea3e441835116fed8a0b8d4f1a1949fee7e","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-blogs_podcasts-the-agent-evaluation-playbook-built-in-deepeval-an-0-6d77a575f5/","observation_id":"obs_6d77a575f579de9bddf060a1269b34c406ecd2d2de042436b64417f39ef25e85","published_at":"2026-11-10T22:35:03Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于智能体评估实践的技术文章，介绍如何以业务目标为起点，将成功标准拆解为可观察行为，再映射到轨迹级或会话级评估器。文章重点讲解 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 中内置评估器、DeepEval 和 AutoEval 的用途及组合方式。","title":"The agent evaluation playbook: Built-in, DeepEval, and AutoEval on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_dc58728fdb34835cc7302873dbedf788913ebe6cb9c8cfb424b0612320c9ad77","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-arxiv-when-does-the-real-wiring-win-testing-connectome-s-1-84af289cec/","observation_id":"obs_84af289cec5a501bf6aa758ab328ce33e3fbacdaa20180b63448ffd878895c78","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:55:48Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究检验神经连接组约束模型的表现优势究竟来自真实布线，还是来自更充分的调参与参数选择。比较区分了迁移生理参数、各自调参以及受独立数据约束三种方案，并用合成真值、安慰剂对照和果蝇回路模型验证。","title":"When Does the Real Wiring Win? Testing connectome structure-function claims against unmeasured physiology"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0c7f0300ee5ba879b0c4a33efd397600d6ac70673f63f91580ed7aef65e2352c","internal_url":"/posts/20261110-arxiv-guiding-data-allocation-for-robust-subpopulation-g-0-a70cf49782/","observation_id":"obs_a70cf49782d88fbad3727501b0d642065d879ba3747b5f463298aff7da02c173","published_at":"2026-11-09T18:59:40Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何在训练数据中分配不同子群体，以提升模型在子群体分布变化下的稳健泛化能力。作者在理论上刻画了不同分配方案的表现，并提出通过梯度调整子群体比例来改善整体调整准确率和最差子群体准确率。","title":"Guiding Data Allocation for Robust Subpopulation Generalization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_b192c524a4542db04537d2b0d9fb88f43d605572fa6606a05a35b63f4dad4c81","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-blogs_podcasts-how-stanford-teaches-ai-native-engineering-mihail--0-2c00110bd6/","observation_id":"obs_2c00110bd6231e5944e32b7c2b10255f3721d5597aa09b393fd97b57c877a8f7","published_at":"2026-11-08T21:41:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一段对 Stanford 课程教师、Monaco AI 负责人 Mihail Eric 的访谈，讨论 AI 时代软件工程师需要学习什么，以及编码代理如何进入课程、代码审查、故障排查和软件交付流程。","title":"How Stanford Teaches AI-Native Engineering — Mihail Eric, Monaco"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_cd3561f842c0907333a36b94ffc5aa11142644d97c075c4b3bddf3879ff2a85e","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-blogs_podcasts-how-to-predict-the-behavior-of-molecules-from-scan-0-0bb49f9654/","observation_id":"obs_0bb49f96544d94ecd80e77ab083459a74cffd73257f1c75429a36d100ed1f6b6","published_at":"2026-11-06T19:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"MIT 团队提出分子性质预测模型 CheMeleon：通过预训练学习分子结构与化学描述符之间的关系，再用少量任务数据微调，以预测溶解度、黏度、生物活性等性质。","title":"How to predict the behavior of molecules from scant data"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_88a612f2b9d9e09fe85c32779b74d6a4a0ca737140afc675eb60eac1496e994b","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-arxiv-xstack-a-benchmark-for-ml-repo-migration-0-c506adad28/","observation_id":"obs_c506adad28825d2b4f3de3c5e292070bbd219fb1a6fa5dc04956dc9de5be67a4","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:55:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"XStack 是一个用于评估 AI 代理跨框架、跨硬件迁移机器学习代码仓库的基准。代理需要把 PyTorch 仓库迁移为可在 TPU 上运行的 JAX 仓库，并通过基于原仓库结果的校准评分。","title":"XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d9826a69ee6bd32f994d304dae3fc4640f1d9d54e6bf7c49de5340934fde7cc0","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-reprobridge-building-reproducibility-into-ml-resea-2-5d920b8c07/","observation_id":"obs_5d920b8c0784633371b19f05fcbc35b545ad7b7b847e7f7676f28bda4f20be55","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:45:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"ReproBridge 将代码、环境配置、实验启动器和复现指南整合成标准化制品，并通过智能体工作流保存实验过程中的操作知识与决策。其目标是提升机器学习实验的独立复现成功率。","title":"ReproBridge: Building Reproducibility into ML Research Artifacts"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_06ecfd74e8f0764da156d99781e805543fd979599d74426a3b344c2cc2a6355d","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-arxiv-data-driven-discovery-of-intrinsic-lie-point-symme-5-42dfe44cf6/","observation_id":"obs_42dfe44cf66a474fac25eca73aea9d3ad1e9644e81be5f908cc85bfd3fcd6283","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:19:28Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究把从微分方程数据中发现连续李点对称性的过程转化为算子问题，在采样的射影空间数据上识别有效生成元，并排除冗余、解相关及几何平凡方向。方法不需要先写出符号确定方程或系统的闭式表示。","title":"Data-driven discovery of intrinsic Lie point symmetries of differential equation systems"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_17d0530e3edf75c33bce4657b5bc86e0e3bcc11f89f25690fd2c883b23b12bda","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-arxiv-on-the-limitations-of-molecular-representations-5-66d4509e32/","observation_id":"obs_66d4509e328b015ac0e2da269af5528d551496c43b9adaeccc7dcb8c365cea37","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:19:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究系统比较了分子指纹、学习型嵌入和理化描述符，发现现有先进嵌入模型在捕捉分子图结构、三维形状及 ADMET 终点相似性方面并未优于传统方法。研究还指出，分子表示的碰撞可能影响虚拟筛选。","title":"On the limitations of molecular representations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":8,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.571429,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":5,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":0.357143,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.285714,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.285714,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.142857,"topic":"Advanced (300)"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Artificial intelligence","id":"tag:Artificial intelligence","jaccard":0.142857,"topic":"Artificial intelligence"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Machine learning","id":"tag:Machine learning","jaccard":0.142857,"topic":"Machine learning"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Research","id":"tag:Research","jaccard":0.142857,"topic":"Research"}],"scenarios":[],"schema_version":"stack_trends_topic_v2","sources":[{"count":7,"name":"arxiv"},{"count":7,"name":"blogs_podcasts"}],"topic":"机器学习","windows":{"24h":null,"30d":{"confidence":"high","counts":{"current":14,"pre_previous":33,"previous":20},"observations":14,"redundant_observations":0,"score":59.98377,"source_diversity":2,"sparkline":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,5,2,3,4],"state":"cooling","unique_events":14,"unique_sources":2},"7d":{"confidence":"high","counts":{"current":8,"pre_prev